{# ===== WHY CHOOSE ARBOR VISION CONSULTING ===== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="align-items: center;">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="section-header__eyebrow">About Mike</span>
        <h2>Why Choose Arbor Vision Consulting</h2>
        <p class="mt-md">Mike Daws is the director and principal arborist at Arbor Vision Consulting. He is qualified both as a climbing arborist (AQF Level 3) and as a consulting arborist (AQF Level 5). Mike is also qualified under the Quantified Tree Risk Assessment framework (QTRA) to conduct formal risk assessment and reporting.</p>
        <p class="mt-md">A background climbing and working in damaged trees has built a strong knowledge base around their behaviour and biomechanics. Mike is uniquely positioned to undertake Level 5 aerial assessments as a climbing consulting arborist.</p>
        <p class="mt-md">Mike has a strong eye for assessing tree condition and identifying structural defects. He prefers to retain trees whenever possible, and can diagnose health, pest, disease and structural issues, offering a plan for remediation.</p>
        <p class="mt-lg">
          <a href="/credentials/" class="btn btn--secondary">View Credentials</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <img
          src="/assets/images/mike-about.png"
          alt="Mike Daws conducting an aerial tree inspection with climbing gear"
          width="800"
          height="450"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          style="border-radius: var(--radius-lg); width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover;"
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== SERVICES CAROUSEL ===== #}
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-header__eyebrow">What We Do</span>
      <h2 class="section-header__title">Our Services</h2>
      <p class="section-header__desc">Comprehensive arboricultural consulting for homeowners, developers, councils and anyone who needs qualified advice about trees - including help with neighbour disputes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel" data-reveal>
      <div class="carousel__track">
        {% for service in site.services %}
          <div
            class="carousel__card"
            data-title="{{ service.name }}"
            data-excerpt="{{ service.excerpt }}"
            data-image="{{ service.image }}"
            data-url="{{ service.url }}"
            role="button"
            tabindex="0"
            aria-label="View details for {{ service.name }}"
          >
            <img
              src="{{ service.image }}"
              alt="{{ service.name }}"
              class="carousel__card-image"
              width="800"
              height="500"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            >
            <div class="carousel__card-body">
              <h3 class="carousel__card-title">{{ service.name }}</h3>
              <p class="carousel__card-text">{{ service.excerpt }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__nav">
        <button class="carousel__prev" aria-label="Previous service">&larr;</button>
        <button class="carousel__next" aria-label="Next service">&rarr;</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-muted">Dealing with a tree dispute between neighbours? Mike provides independent, qualified assessments that can help resolve disagreements fairly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-lg">
      <a href="/services/" class="btn btn--primary">All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

