{# ===== DA SUPPORT HIGHLIGHT ===== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="align-items: center;">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="section-header__eyebrow">DA Support</span>
        <h2>Development Application Tree Reports</h2>
        <p class="mt-md">Submitting a development application? Your council may require an arborist report from an AQF Level 5 qualified arborist. Mike prepares professional reports including arboricultural impact assessments, preliminary assessments, and tree removal/retention plans.</p>
        <p class="mt-md">AutoCAD is used to produce detailed and accurate assessments. Reports are prepared to satisfy council specifications.</p>
        <p class="mt-lg">
          <a href="/da-support/" class="btn btn--primary">Learn More</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <img
          src="/assets/images/hero-da-support.jpg"
          alt="Tree canopy assessment for development application"
          width="800"
          height="600"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          style="border-radius: var(--radius-lg); width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover;"
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

