        <p class="mt-md">Mike Daws is a passionate arborist with a genuine love for trees. Mike has a background in tree climbing, previously running a business specialising in tree maintenance, difficult access pruning and habitat creation. A progression to consulting was only natural, building on the strong familiarity with the physiology and behaviour of trees earned through a career of pruning.</p>
